{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A \"stair-step\" figure is made of alternating black and white squares in each row. Rows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are shown. All rows begin and end with a white square. The number of black squares in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92dd94f6ba1d5f5da7d7bd01174b3872645096a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$37\\text{th}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> row is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16bbf453deb73effcd29c04ae7b433e465c6cffd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(7,0)--(7,1)--(0,1)--cycle); draw((1,0)--(6,0)--(6,2)--(1,2)--cycle); draw((2,0)--(5,0)--(5,3)--(2,3)--cycle); draw((3,0)--(4,0)--(4,4)--(3,4)--cycle); fill((1,0)--(2,0)--(2,1)--(1,1)--cycle,black); fill((3,0)--(4,0)--(4,1)--(3,1)--cycle,black); fill((5,0)--(6,0)--(6,1)--(5,1)--cycle,black); fill((2,1)--(3,1)--(3,2)--(2,2)--cycle,black); fill((4,1)--(5,1)--(5,2)--(4,2)--cycle,black); fill((3,2)--(4,2)--(4,3)--(3,3)--cycle,black); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/2/3b20d802d3935999f6b74169cca7e2d6b3e11ca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 34 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 35 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 36 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 37 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 38$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first row has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> black squares, while each row after the first has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more black square than the previous row.  Therefore, the second row has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> black square, the third row has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> black squares, and so on, until the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10e12fb1b94d3ec975a4260acbd4d73b13c2afd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$37^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> row has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d807911fa358bb38b9df246454583e6b25528f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" /> black squares.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> be the number of black squares in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f0b29305e947b3755e0703980ff2aa077e72d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> row.  Since each row has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more black square than the previous row, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is linear with slope <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/3/293802f0e6b4e686117cc216955e798f1e094a9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = n + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" /> for some constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82dd6f474fd8d40d5108934acc4ce4f98bfd3c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84bf3a5f10fc4fa93e57f4c345f5f79a6ac26e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 1 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce67f0e5287f11dc65e3f81673742d580064d9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e310af3a46ef2f69507ce64e44bb1b0c7ef58271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10e12fb1b94d3ec975a4260acbd4d73b13c2afd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$37^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> row has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e676e289739f254a4a7ce2d76dcea0d13fa409d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(37) = 37 - 1 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"207\" height=\"30\" /> black squares.\n</p><p>~sakshamsethi, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TjN47q5-Fuw\">https://youtu.be/TjN47q5-Fuw</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n